                                "sense_id": "3a903a57-0172-3057-a41e-89cdfa52d6aa",
                                "text": "1948, William S. Lieberman, \"Modern French Tapestries,\" The Metropolitan Museum of Art Bulletin, New Series, vol. 6, no. 5, p. 142,\nAs Jean Lurcat said, \"The art had died, killed by consumption, insipidness, lymphatism, and inversion.\""
                            }
                        ]
